  "title": "Reserve Airmen rescue Hurricane Harvey victims",
  "description": "Air Force Reservists from the 920th Rescue Wing, Patrick Air Force Base, Florida, safely hand off a Hurricane Harvey victim they hoisted onto their HH-60 Pave Hawk helicopter, to crews at a safe haven collection point in Beaumont, Texas, Aug. 31, 2017. The 920th RQW deployed roughly 90 Air Force reservists, three HH-60 Pave Hawks and two HC-130Ns to Texas in support of Air Force Northern's search and rescue mission for FEMA disaster relief effort. (U.S. Air Force video/Tech. Sgt. Lindsey Maurice)",
